\title{The Yoneda lemma and complete Segal spaces in Homotopy Type Theory}
\taxon{Talk}
\author{fredrikbakke}
\import{common}
\date{2024-06-06}
\meta{venue}{FMF, [[uljubljana]]}
\meta{source}{[Abstract](https://www.fmf.uni-lj.si/en/news/event/1569/fredrik-bakke-egbert-rijke/)}

\abstract{
We'll wrap up the story from [last time](talk-fmf-2024-05) by proving the Yoneda
lemma for Segal types and seeing how it generalizes identity induction, then we'll
discuss univalence.
}
